  "description": "<p xss=removed><span xss=removed>Decoupeerzaag STEB 65 Quick</span></p>\r\n<ul xss=removed>\r\n<li xss=removed><span xss=removed>Vario (V)</span>-elektronica</li>\r\n<li xss=removed><span xss=removed>Metabo Quick</span> - gereedschapsloze zaagbladwissel</li>\r\n<li xss=removed>beugelgreep met antislip softgrip-oppervlak</li>\r\n<li xss=removed>afzuigmogelijkheid door aansluiting van een alleszuiger</li>\r\n<li xss=removed>spaanblaasfunctie voor vrij zicht op het zaagbereik</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed>Technische gegevens:</span></p>\r\n<ul xss=removed>\r\n<li xss=removed><span xss=removed>opgenomen vermogen: </span>450 W<span xss=removed><br xss=removed></span></li>\r\n<li xss=removed><span xss=removed>afgegeven vermogen: </span>230 W<span xss=removed><br xss=removed></span></li>\r\n<li xss=removed><span xss=removed>zaagdiepte hout: </span>65 mm<span xss=removed><br xss=removed></span></li>\r\n<li xss=removed><span xss=removed>zaagdiepte NF-metaal: </span>18 mm<span xss=removed><br xss=removed></span></li>\r\n<li xss=removed><span xss=removed>zaagdiepte plaatstaal:</span> 6 mm<span xss=removed><br xss=removed></span></li>\r\n<li xss=removed><span xss=removed>hoekinstelling van/tot:</span> t- 45 / + 45°<span xss=removed><br xss=removed></span></li>\r\n<li xss=removed><span xss=removed>pendelslag-standen:</span> 4<span xss=removed><br xss=removed></span></li>\r\n<li xss=removed><span xss=removed>aantal slagen bij onbelast draaien: </span>600 - 3 000 /min<span xss=removed><br xss=removed></span></li>\r\n<li xss=removed><span xss=removed>zaagslaglengte: </span>18 mm<span xss=removed><br xss=removed></span></li>\r\n<li xss=removed><span xss=removed>gewicht zonder netsnoer: </span>1.9 kg<span xss=removed><br xss=removed></span></li>\r\n<li xss=removed><span xss=removed>kabellengte: </span>2.5 m</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p xss=removed><span xss=removed>Trilling</span></p>\r\n<ul xss=removed>\r\n<li xss=removed><span xss=removed>zagen hout:</s